        "html": "\u003cdiv class=\"mockup-component--cover-metadata\">\n\u003cdl class=\"cover-metadata\">\n      \u003cdiv class=\"cover-metadata-item\">\u003cdt>작성자\u003c/dt>\u003cdd>그로스마케팅랩\u003c/dd>\u003c/div>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"cover-metadata-item\">\u003cdt>버전\u003c/dt>\u003cdd>v0.1\u003c/dd>\u003c/div>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"cover-metadata-item\">\u003cdt>최초 생성일\u003c/dt>\u003cdd>2026/09/16\u003c/dd>\u003c/div>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"cover-metadata-item\">\u003cdt>최종 수정일\u003c/dt>\u003cdd>2026/09/22\u003c/dd>\u003c/div>\n    \u003c/dl>\n\u003c/div>",
